{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Approach and grab object, process it. If target visible, move to and perform task, else move to random.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = IsDestinationVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = IsDestinationNotVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
